  "2026-10-16T22:45:30.304Z",codex-agent,"Measured 68 contract comparisons: all text and focus comparisons pass; 10 border comparisons fail 3:1 (light canary/rose; canceled rule borders in both themes). Contract retained unchanged. Proposed minimal changes and complete ratios will be recorded in docs/contrast.md and the PR; owner decision required. No AA claim for those borders."
  "2026-10-16T22:51:12.062Z",codex-agent,"Concrete proposal: light in-progress border #A28928, light blocked border #B96A82, canceled border var(--pm-graphite) in both themes. These retain all base palette values and meet 3:1 against chip fills, paper and sheet. Proposed values have dedicated tests; implementation awaits owner approval."
